msgstr ""

#. Skin Element Text: txt- balak / Text
msgid ""
"Selamat datang di Lamban Balak Keratuan Darah Putih, jantung budaya Saibatin "
"di Lampung Selatan! Rasakan keagungan tradisi Lampung melalui rumah adat "
"panggung yang bersejarah, dihiasi siger pusaka dan ornamen khas. Destinasi "
"ini mengajak Anda menyelami kekayaan budaya melalui tur edukatif, workshop "
"kain tapis, dan ritual adat seperti Nyambai Bujenong. Terletak di Desa "
"Kuripan, hanya 20 menit dari Kalianda, tempat ini menawarkan pengalaman "
"autentik untuk pecinta sejarah dan budaya. Nikmati pelayanan ramah dan "
"fasilitas lengkap untuk perjalanan penuh makna. Sambut petualangan budaya "
"yang tak terlupakan di Lampung!"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Lamban Balak Keratuan Darah Putih, the cultural heart of the "
"Saibatin people in South Lampung! Experience the majesty of Lampung "
"tradition through this historic raised-floor traditional house, adorned with "
"the ancestral siger crown and distinctive ornaments. Located in Kuripan "
"Village, just 20 minutes from Kalianda, this destination invites you to "
"delve into rich local heritage through educational tours, tapis cloth "
"workshops, and traditional rituals like Nyambai Bujenong. Offering authentic "
"experiences for history and culture enthusiasts, with friendly service and "
"complete facilities, prepare for an unforgettable cultural adventure in "
"Lampung."

#. Skin Element Text: txt- kalianda / Text
msgid ""
"Selamat datang di Rumah Adat Lamban Balak Bandar Marga Legun, simbol budaya "
"Pepadun di Bandar Lampung! Rasakan pesona tradisi Lampung melalui arsitektur "
"panggung megah, siger pusaka, dan ornamen khas. Destinasi ini menawarkan tur "
"edukatif, workshop kain tapis, dan demo ritual begawi untuk pengalaman "
"budaya yang mendalam. Terletak di Teluk Betung Barat, mudah diakses dari "
"pusat kota, tempat ini cocok untuk pecinta sejarah dan budaya. Dengan "
"pelayanan ramah dan fasilitas lengkap, nikmati perjalanan penuh makna yang "
"menghidupkan warisan Lampung. \n"
"Ayo, jelajahi kekayaan budaya di sini!"
msgstr ""
"Welcome to Lamban Balak Bandar Marga Legun Traditional House, a symbol of "
"the Pepadun culture in Bandar Lampung! Experience the charm of Lampung "
"tradition through its magnificent raised-floor architecture, ancestral siger "
"crown, and distinctive ornaments. Located in West Teluk Betung and easily "
"accessible from the city center, this destination offers educational tours, "
"tapis cloth workshops, and begawi ritual demonstrations for a deeply "
"immersive cultural experience. With friendly service and complete "
"facilities, this site is perfect for history and culture enthusiasts, "
"promising a meaningful journey that brings Lampung's heritage to life. Come, "
"explore the cultural richness here!"

